sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuario
  participant F as Frontend
  participant B as Backend (sesion)
  participant A as IA
  participant D as PostgreSQL

  U->>F: abre /demo
  F->>B: connect (auth.sessionId)
  B->>D: crear SimulationSession
  B-->>F: state (vehiculos)
  loop cada 50 ms
    B->>B: spawn / mover / encolar
    B->>A: POST /decision (queue, occupant) [managed-ai]
    A-->>B: vehicleId (o fallback FIFO)
    B-->>F: state (20 Hz)
  end
  U->>F: gamepad / clic
  F->>B: playerState / freeze / reset
  B-->>F: state actualizado
  B->>D: registrar cruces y violaciones (asincrono)
  U->>F: cierra /demo
  B->>D: endedAt de la sesion
